+  // A head captured while empty is private. Public head fields are zero
+  // until the unchanged acceptance logic publishes count. A first accepted
+  // sample and its count become visible on the same edge. Thus raw validation
+  // does not drive this181-bit hold mux, and invalid/unaccepted fields cannot
+  // become visible or enter a FIFO row. Refill preserves its original edge.
